```css
.panel { container-type: inline-size; container-name: panel; }

/* baseline: stacked, works everywhere */
.card { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }

@container panel (min-width: 32rem) {
  .card { grid-template-columns: 12rem minmax(0, 1fr); }  /* side by side */
}
```

| Piece | Job |
|---|---|
| `container-type: inline-size`. | makes the ancestor measurable by width. |
| `container-name`. | lets queries target a specific container. |
| `@container (…)`. | styles that apply when that container matches. |
| baseline styles. | the layout if the query doesn't apply. |
| `cqi` units. | 1% of the container's inline size. |

